<title>FRANCE: Two wheat ships expected in Rouen by September 28.</title>
<headline>Two wheat ships expected in Rouen by September 28.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships were expected in Rouen by September 28 to load some 13,000 tonnes of wheat, port officials said on Tuesday. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>In Rouen, three ships were currently loading 19,000 tonnes of wheat destined for west Africa, Spain and Georgia, they said. --Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
